      "id": "rule:runtime-owns-artifact-paths",
      "kind": "architecture_rule",
      "statement": "Producers write an artifact only to the path the runtime supplies as context expected_output_path and never recompute artifacts/<id>.md themselves. The one sanctioned flat-path fallback is skill_executor.resolve_output_path when an executor runs standalone with no supplied path; the runtime resolves paths in OrchestrationRunner._resolve_artifact_path.",
