    {
      "id": "observation:legacy-plan-producer-overwrites-tracked-plan",
      "kind": "observation",
      "statement": "SkillsOrchestrator.run_workflow_planner_skill() runs the legacy WorkflowPlannerSkill, which writes workflow_orchestration_plan to <project_root>/artifacts/workflow_orchestration_plan.md through BaseSkill.write_artifact rather than a runtime-supplied path. Its generated sections omit the contract's required sections, and it reports success.",
